SUMMARY:Queer Comedy Party\, fall rooftop edition
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Comedy Fans\nEvery Thursday Modelface Comedy Club br
 ings the best local and touring comedians to Asheville! This week we have 
 a special Pride Month Show on the rooftop at Antidote!\nChemist Spirts wel
 comes top comedians for a night of laughs. Enjoy a stunning AVL sunset fro
 m the rooftop bar at Antidote while giggling and sipping a classic cocktai
 l.\n\nThe Queer Comedy Party is a night celebrating many of the talented q
 ueer comedians in Asheville and all over the country. All the performers a
 re queer identifying but the audience doesn't have to be.\nages 21+\n\ndoo
 rs at 6:30pm\, show at 7pm\nTickets $15 advance\, $18 day of\n[https://www
 .eventbrite.com/.../queer-comedy-party-fall...](https://www.eventbrite.com
